<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES RESULTS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results and close of play</p>
<p>scores on the third day of four-day Supersport series  cricket</p>
<p>matches on Sunday:</p>
<p>In Durban (final day): Natal beat Boland by eight wickets.</p>
<p>Boland 133 and 201 (G.Gilder 5-60). Natal 198 and 137-2</p>
<p>(D.Watson 51 not out.</p>
<p>In Kimberley: Free State 493, Griqualand West 340 (M.Arthur</p>
<p>57, M.Gidley 52, P.Barnard 52, B.Player 4-41) and 14-0.</p>
<p>In Cape Town: Western Province beat Border by eight wickets.</p>
<p>Border 210 and 185 (M.Boucher 68 not out, B.Schultz 5-69,</p>
<p>M.Pringle 4-26), Western Province 290 and 106-2.</p>
<p>In Johannesburg: Transvaal 334 and 272-3 (A.Bacher 114,</p>
<p>N.McKenzie 53 not out), Eastern Province 261</p>
